# Enforce LF line endings across all platforms.
#
# This repository targets Linux/WSL; every tracked shell script is executed
# by bash under WSL. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# tracked text to CRLF, which breaks bash heredocs (syntax error, exit 2)
# and corrupts the 258 committed scripts on disk.
#
# All committed blobs are already LF, so this is content-neutral: it only
# pins the invariant and stops future Windows checkouts from regressing it.
* text=auto eol=lf
